				<wikidot:authorName>Drewbear</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>301632</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Although I'm taken with the idea of a hairless, porpoise-like mermaid rather than the Ariel-style one, I think that otherwise this SCP is too straight-forward of a take on mermaids/sirens. I would like to see a rewrite, although not necessarily a grimdark one. Perhaps addressing whether or not she's the only one or if there's a whole race of these hiding out there? Perhaps she's actually an example of a hyper-evolved porpoise? Perhaps she's a genetically engineered human/porpoise hybrid?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
